-v-montgomery/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: People v. Montgomery\">494 N. E. 2d 475</a></span>; No. 86-5801, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1211303\"><a href=\"/opinion/1211303/hill-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hill v. State\">102 Nev. 377</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1211303\"><a href=\"/opinion/1211303/hill-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hill v. State\">724 P. 2d 734</a></span>; No. 86-5906, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9732853\"><a href=\"/opinion/2184198/people-v-szabo/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: People v. Szabo\">113 Ill. 2d 83</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9732853\"><a href=\"/opinion/2184198/people-v-szabo/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: People v. Szabo\">497 N. E. 2d 995</a></span>; No. 86-5958, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1116062\"><a href=\"/opinion/1116062/cooper-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Cooper v. State\">492 So. 2d 1059</a></span>; No. 86-5994, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"6759410\"><a href=\"/opinion/6868161/state-v-brooks/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Brooks\">25 Ohio St. 3d 144</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"6759410\"><a href=\"/opinion/6868161/state-v-brooks/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Brooks\">495 N. E. 2d 407</a></span>; No. 86-6017, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9772145\"><a href=\"/opinion/2432958/hill-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hill v. State\">289 Ark. 387</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9772145\"><a href=\"/opinion/2432958/hill-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hill v. State\">713 S. W. 2d 233</a></span>; No. 86-6026, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1094554\"><a href=\"/opinion/1094554/ex-parte-wright/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Ex Parte Wright\">494 So. 2d 745</a></span>; No. 86-6033, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9678161\"><a href=\"/opinion/1756005/state-v-c